<title>USA: Ariz. Public Service rate cut approved.</title>
<headline>Ariz. Public Service rate cut approved.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Arizona Corporation Commission approved late Wednesday an electricity rate decrease of $17.6 million filed by Arizona Public Service Co (APS), in accordance with a 1996 settlement agreement, the utility said.</p>
<p>APS, a subsidiary of Pinnacle West Capital Corp, said the new rates will go into effect July 1 for all customers.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761))</p>
